00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:17.840
So on this plane, pure resistance lies along&nbsp;
the horizontal axis where phase is zero. Since

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.360
we care about positive resistances, we're only&nbsp;
going to look at the right side of the plane.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:26.080
Now compare that to pure capacitors and&nbsp;
